50
00:02:07.950 --> 00:02:12.950
flooding every city that we spent centuries building?

51
00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:15.827
I mean, how selfish can you be to say,

52
00:02:15.827 --> 00:02:18.840
"Oh my descendants, they'll have to deal with it.

53
00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:20.760
But right now I'm gonna maximize

54
00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:23.170
every threat of profit I can"?

55
00:02:23.170 --> 00:02:26.370
So I'd look at the beautiful civilization

56
00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:27.640
that we have crafted.

57
00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:29.490
I don't wanna lose it.
I agree.

58
00:02:29.490 --> 00:02:34.470
And, in fact, your beautiful book, which is your 18th book.

59
00:02:34.470 --> 00:02:35.303
I wasn't keeping track.

60
00:02:35.303 --> 00:02:37.837
18th!
I wasn't keeping track.

61
00:02:37.837 --> 00:02:39.420
"Welcome to the Universe."

62
00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:40.510
What's good about it,

63
00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:42.680
