69
00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:03.970 line:15%
And it's the world building that this... (laughs)

70
00:03:04.059 --> 00:03:07.140
How freaking cool is this, you guys?

71
00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:10.300
No book comes with this, Neil, I love you so much.

72
00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:12.100
It's hard to produce a book like this.

73
00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:13.690
No, it's not easy!
Right, right, right.

74
00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:16.420
So it takes you from the small out to the large,

75
00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:17.660
